{"seq":2,"slug":"kg-enhanced-llm","title":"知识图谱增强 LLM","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/knowledge-graphs/kg-applications/kg-enhanced-llm","wordCount":1704,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"知识图谱增强-llm\">知识图谱增强 LLM</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>知识图谱增强 LLM（KG-Enhanced LLM）是将知识图谱的结构化知识与大语言模型的自然语言处理能力结合的技术方向。LLM 擅长自然语言理解和生成但容易产生幻觉，KG 提供精确可验证的事实知识但缺乏灵活的自然语言交互能力。两者结合可以显著减少幻觉、提升事实准确性。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph KG 增强 LLM 范式&#10;        PRE[预训练增强] --&gt; KEPLER[KEPLER 2021]&#10;        PRE --&gt; ERNIE_M[ERNIE 2019]&#10;        RAG_K[检索增强] --&gt; KGRAG[KG-RAG]&#10;        RAG_K --&gt; TOG_M[Think-on-Graph 2023]&#10;        RAG_K --&gt; GR[GraphRAG 及其后继 2024+]&#10;        POST[后处理验证] --&gt; FACT[事实核查]&#10;        POST --&gt; EDIT[知识编辑]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph KG 增强 LLM 范式\n        PRE[预训练增强] --&gt; KEPLER[KEPLER 2021]\n        PRE --&gt; ERNIE_M[ERNIE 2019]\n        RAG_K[检索增强] --&gt; KGRAG[KG-RAG]\n        RAG_K --&gt; TOG_M[Think-on-Graph 2023]\n        RAG_K --&gt; GR[GraphRAG 及其后继 2024+]\n        POST[后处理验证] --&gt; FACT[事实核查]\n        POST --&gt; EDIT[知识编辑]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>结合范式</th>\n<th>时机</th>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>预训练注入</td>\n<td>模型训练阶段</td>\n<td>KG 嵌入对齐</td>\n<td>深度融合</td>\n<td>需要重新训练</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>检索增强</td>\n<td>推理阶段</td>\n<td>KG 检索+上下文</td>\n<td>无需重训</td>\n<td>增加延迟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工具调用</td>\n<td>推理阶段</td>\n<td>API 查询 KG</td>\n<td>灵活精确</td>\n<td>依赖工具设计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>后处理验证</td>\n<td>生成后</td>\n<td>KG 事实核查</td>\n<td>减少幻觉</td>\n<td>只能过滤不能生成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>知识编辑</td>\n<td>模型更新</td>\n<td>定向修改参数</td>\n<td>精细控制</td>\n<td>规模受限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"kg-rag-检索增强\">KG-RAG 检索增强</h2><p>KG-RAG（Knowledge Graph Retrieval Augmented Generation）将知识图谱作为 RAG 的知识源，在 LLM 生成回答之前从 KG 中检索相关的结构化知识，作为上下文提供给模型。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface KGRAGConfig {&#10;  kg: KnowledgeGraph;&#10;  llm: LLMClient;&#10;  entityLinker: EntityLinker;&#10;  maxTriples: number;&#10;  maxHops: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;async function kgRAG(question: string, config: KGRAGConfig): Promise&lt;{ answer: string; sources: Triple[] }&gt; {&#10;  const entities = await config.entityLinker.link(question);&#10;  const relevantTriples: Triple[] = [];&#10;&#10;  for (const entity of entities) {&#10;    const neighbors = config.kg.getNeighborTriples(entity.kgId, config.maxHops);&#10;    const ranked = rankTriplesByRelevance(question, neighbors);&#10;    relevantTriples.push(...ranked.slice(0, config.maxTriples));&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  const context = formatTriplesAsContext(relevantTriples);&#10;  const prompt = buildKGRAGPrompt(question, context);&#10;  const answer = await config.llm.generate(prompt);&#10;&#10;  return { answer, sources: relevantTriples };&#10;}&#10;&#10;function formatTriplesAsContext(triples: Triple[]): string {&#10;  return triples.map((t) =&gt; `${t.subject} - ${t.predicate} - ${t.object}`).join(&#39;\\n&#39;);&#10;}&#10;&#10;function buildKGRAGPrompt(question: string, kgContext: string): string {&#10;  return `基于以下知识图谱信息回答问题。如果信息不足，请说明。&#10;&#10;知识图谱信息：&#10;${kgContext}&#10;&#10;问题：${question}&#10;回答：`;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> KGRAGConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  kg</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> KnowledgeGraph</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  llm</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LLMClient</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  entityLinker</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> EntityLinker</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  maxTriples</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  maxHops</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> kgRAG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">question</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">config</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> KGRAGConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;{ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">answer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">sources</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Triple</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] }> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> entities</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> config.entityLinker.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">link</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(question);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> relevantTriples</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Triple</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> entity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entities) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> neighbors</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> config.kg.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getNeighborTriples</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(entity.kgId, config.maxHops);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ranked</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> rankTriplesByRelevance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(question, neighbors);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    relevantTriples.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ranked.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">slice</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, config.maxTriples));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> context</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> formatTriplesAsContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(relevantTriples);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> prompt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> buildKGRAGPrompt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(question, context);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> answer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> config.llm.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">generate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(prompt);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { answer, sources: relevantTriples };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> formatTriplesAsContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">triples</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Triple</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> triples.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">t</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">subject</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} - ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">t</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">predicate</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} - ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">t</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">object</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">join</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> buildKGRAGPrompt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">question</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">kgContext</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `基于以下知识图谱信息回答问题。如果信息不足，请说明。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">知识图谱信息：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">kgContext</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">问题：${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">question</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">回答：`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>与传统文档 RAG 相比，KG-RAG 的优势是：知识以结构化形式存储，精确可控；三元组的粒度更细，减少了无关信息的干扰；图谱的关联关系支持多跳推理；知识的来源和置信度可追溯。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>文档 RAG</th>\n<th>KG-RAG</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>知识粒度</td>\n<td>文本片段（段落/句子）</td>\n<td>三元组（精确事实）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>检索方式</td>\n<td>向量相似度匹配</td>\n<td>实体链接 + 图遍历</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多跳推理</td>\n<td>困难（需多次检索）</td>\n<td>原生支持（图谱路径）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>知识更新</td>\n<td>重新索引文档</td>\n<td>更新三元组（增量）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可溯源性</td>\n<td>指向源文档</td>\n<td>指向具体三元组和来源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>噪声干扰</td>\n<td>段落中混入无关信息</td>\n<td>三元组粒度精确</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>知识密集型文档问答</td>\n<td>事实核查、结构化问答</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>KG-RAG 在实际部署中面临的主要挑战是实体链接的准确率。如果用户问题中的实体被错误地链接到图谱中的错误实体，后续检索的三元组将完全不相关，导致生成结果偏离。因此，实体链接的置信度阈值设置和回退策略（低置信度时降级为文档 RAG）是 KG-RAG 系统可靠性的关键保障。</p>\n<h2 id=\"llm-驱动的-kg-构建\">LLM 驱动的 KG 构建</h2><p>反过来，LLM 也可以增强知识图谱的构建。LLM 的强大语言理解能力使得从非结构化文本中抽取实体和关系变得更加准确和灵活。截至本篇更新（2026-08），&quot;LLM 抽取三元组 + 本体 Schema 校验&quot;已成为 GraphRAG 类系统构建图谱的标准路径——微软 GraphRAG、LightRAG 等主流实现的图谱构建层均基于此。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface LLMKGExtractor {&#10;  llm: LLMClient;&#10;  schema: OntologySchema;&#10;  validationKG: KnowledgeGraph;&#10;}&#10;&#10;async function extractTriplesByLLM(text: string, schema: OntologySchema, llm: LLMClient): Promise&lt;Triple[]&gt; {&#10;  const entityTypes = schema.classes.map((c) =&gt; c.label).join(&#39;, &#39;);&#10;  const relationTypes = schema.properties.map((p) =&gt; p.label).join(&#39;, &#39;);&#10;&#10;  const prompt = `从以下文本中提取知识三元组。&#10;实体类型：${entityTypes}&#10;关系类型：${relationTypes}&#10;&#10;文本：${text}&#10;&#10;请以JSON数组格式输出三元组，每个三元组包含 subject、predicate、object 字段：`;&#10;&#10;  const response = await llm.generate(prompt);&#10;  const triples = parseTriples(response);&#10;  return validateTriples(triples, schema);&#10;}&#10;&#10;function validateTriples(triples: Triple[], schema: OntologySchema): Triple[] {&#10;  return triples.filter((t) =&gt; {&#10;    const relation = schema.properties.find((p) =&gt; p.label === t.predicate);&#10;    if (!relation) return false;&#10;    return true;&#10;  });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LLMKGExtractor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  llm</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LLMClient</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  schema</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OntologySchema</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  validationKG</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> KnowledgeGraph</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> extractTriplesByLLM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">schema</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OntologySchema</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E